\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. I hear Thy welcome voice
\par That calls me, Lord, to Thee,
\par For cleansing in Thy precious blood
\par That flowed on Calvary.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I am coming, Lord,
\par Coming now to Thee:
\par Wash me, cleanse me, by the blood
\par That flowed on Calvary.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Though coming weak and vile,
\par Thou dost my strength assure;
\par Thou dost my vileness fully cleanse,
\par Till spotless all and pure.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I am coming, Lord,
\par Coming now to Thee:
\par Wash me, cleanse me, by the blood
\par That flowed on Calvary.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. 'Tis Jesus calls me on
\par To perfect faith and love,
\par To perfect hope, and peace, and trust,
\par For earth and heaven above.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I am coming, Lord,
\par Coming now to Thee:
\par Wash me, cleanse me, by the blood
\par That flowed on Calvary.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. 'Tis Jesus who confirms
\par The blessed work within,
\par By adding grace to welcomed grace,
\par Where reigned the power of sin.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I am coming, Lord,
\par Coming now to Thee:
\par Wash me, cleanse me, by the blood
\par That flowed on Calvary.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. All hail, atoning blood!
\par All hail, redeeming grace!
\par All hail, the gift of Christ our Lord,
\par Our strength and Righteousness!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par I am coming, Lord,
\par Coming now to Thee:
\par Wash me, cleanse me, by the blood
\par That flowed on Calvary.
\par \f1 
